#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm
msgid ""
"The B<makedev>(), B<major>(), and B<minor>()  functions are not specified in "
"POSIX.1, but are present on many other systems."
msgstr ""
"Функции B<makedev>(), B<major>() и B<minor>() не описаны в POSIX.1, однако "
